<title>MOROCCO: Morocco T-bill auction raises 535 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Morocco T-bill auction raises 535 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Treasury raised 535 million dirhams at its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>RATES AND AMOUNTS (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	 AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	  35	  35		  7.0</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 200	 200		  8.0</p>
<p>    Two years	 40	  40		  8.25</p>
<p>    Five years     110	 110		  9.00</p>
<p>    10 years	 150	 150		  9.50</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    535	 535</p>
<p>Maturity date was set on August 5, 1997.</p>
<p>($ = 9.8 dirhams)</p>
</text>
